This is an original automation script for pulling, saving, and pushing container
images. It installs and uses the following third-party open-source software (all
credit to their respective authors):

  Docker / Moby           Apache-2.0   https://github.com/moby/moby
   incl. containerd.io, buildx, docker-compose-plugin   Apache-2.0

This tool is a generic image mover: it pulls, saves to a tarball, and pushes
container images that the USER specifies (via a manifest file or `.tar.gz`). The
licenses of those user-selected images are the user's responsibility — this
project neither selects nor redistributes any fixed set of images itself.
